<title>UK: Exmoor Dual says may get offer for firm.</title>
<headline>Exmoor Dual says may get offer for firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exmoor Dual Investment Trust Plc said on Thursday it received an approach that might lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>The trust's statement did not give further details.</p>
<p>Exmoor's shares were indicated 2.0p higher at 8.5p by 1329.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
